    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it isn't just a \"mistake\" you can learn from. i can still see their faces. i can't un-do what happened. it feels like i'm just carrying this rot around with me, and it's not just hurting me, it's poisoning everyone who has to be near me. how am i supposed to \"rebuild\" when the thing i did is permanent? some things are just broken forever.",
